{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"人文字やねん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生で1回誰しもが\nやっちゃう。\nあれやねん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、今回は少ない人数で\n何の文字作るか迷ったんや。\nだがな4人で作れる文字\n言うたらこれしか思い\nつかへんかったんや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これやねん！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/02/02/7361459/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これやねん！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/02/02/7361459/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんまにふぁみたんの皆さん\n分かりますか？( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、2枚目が分かり\nずらいって違うわーーーー！\nそこを見てほしいんちゃう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文字を見て欲しいんや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちま監督が撮って\nくれたんやけどうちら\nまるまったりしとるから\n分からないさかい、\n監督に指示してもらったんや！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを努力の結晶と言うや！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほな！明日は\n撮影さかいうちは先に\nおいとまさせてもらいまっせ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほな！( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}